Haven't you stuffed your face yet?

1582
01:46:00.125 --> 01:46:02.582
I've just eaten six, seven
sandwiches, there was no time.

1583
01:46:03.000 --> 01:46:04.540
Glutton of the topmost order.

1584
01:46:05.750 --> 01:46:08.332
