Shruti. One minute...

1701
01:54:51.416 --> 01:54:52.707
sit down...

1702
01:54:55.583 --> 01:54:57.082
listen to the plan for the future.

1703
01:54:58.458 --> 01:55:00.290
Enough of the I-spy.

1704
01:55:01.208 --> 01:55:04.207
Happy Wedding is finished,

1705
